Hi Amelia,

Sorry for the delayed response.

https://epsg.io/3577 says that EPSG:3577 is in the GRS 1980 datum.

The data & model fit objects need to be in the same projection in meters. You seem to be saying that they are not? This should cause an error, and if it doesn't then I will double check the code.

I suspect the original issue is from the datum. When you import long-lat data, you need to supply the datum if it is not the default WGS84, and GRS80 is not the default WGS84.

Best,
Chris

